  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在遊戲中加入可愛的可馴服老鼠，它們會在需要時與你戰鬥並保護你。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">而且它們非常可愛。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">預設情況下，它們會生成於森林、沙漠和惡地生物羣系中。<br>（在 Forge 版本中，你可透過編輯 data -> biome tags 與 biome modifier 資料夾內的 JSON 檔案，或使用資源包來修改此設定及其他生成條件；在 Fabric 版本中則提供專屬設定檔供調整）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">有 10% 的機率會生成精英鼠。（體型較大且更強壯，不過依然很可愛……）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">它們共有 8 種顏色變體。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">有時它們會向你要食物吃。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以使用任何食物物品來馴服或繁殖它們</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">若餵食腐肉，它們的攻擊將使目標中毒 15 秒。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（此增益效果持續 15 分鐘）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模組目前支援</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1094/199/logo.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>若你需要 CurseForge 上其他版本的模組，請發送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X (Twitter) 上關注我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>本模組需要安裝 AQUARIUSLIBS</strong></a></span></p>",
